  "comments": [
    {
      "id": "14135",
      "body": "Hi User:600810992b411b0076aaf4cc \n\nSee comments below:\n\nAC3 - If a client cannot add this item to the wishlist should the wishlist button either be hidden or visually greyed out? Is this achievable?\n\nAC4 - If a product’s most recent price was marked down following a sale period, would the original price be displayed or the was/now pricing? User:61f1c44458ce4f006895680f what is the as-is behaviour here?\n\nAll other AC’s are approved.\n\n**Note:** I am providing sign off of the functional behaviour of this ticket - any reference to error message copy is purely indicative and I believe should be configurable.",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Emma Kirwan",
        "name": "Emma Kirwan",
        "email": null,
        "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/437c30dd63bbb0ec0a2f7c0d8d556d93?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FEK-4.png"
