    {
      "id": "14153",
      "body": "HiUser:712020:c99d37b3-9c93-4347-951d-5ffb32ff1341 AC4 - The current behaviour is to display the WAS and NOW pricing whenever a product is on sale or marked down. The Original Price is displayed as the WAS price.\n\ncc User:600810992b411b0076aaf4cc",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Kim Simbulan",
