    {
      "id": "14176",
      "body": "Hi User:600810992b411b0076aaf4cc \n\nAC3 \n\n- Given a line item is in an unavailable state, when the cart renders, then the Remove link remains visible and functional, and the Wishlist link is visible but disabled — the customer cannot save an unavailable product to their wishlist as it no longer exists on the storefront.\n\nCan we update it to:\n\n\n  - Given a line item is in an unavailable state, when the cart renders, then the Remove link remains visible and functional, and the Wishlist link is visible but disabled **but visually greyed out* — the customer cannot save an unavailable product to their wishlist as it no longer exists on the storefront.\n\nonce updated I will sign off",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Emma Kirwan",
        "name": "Emma Kirwan",
        "email": null,
        "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/437c30dd63bbb0ec0a2f7c0d8d556d93?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FEK-4.png"
